
TY  - JOUR
T1  - A Design-Task-Oriented Model Assignment Method in Model-Based System Engineering
AU  - Wang, Xiaofei
AU  - Liao, Wenhe
AU  - Guo, Yu
AU  - Liu, Daoyuan
AU  - Qian, Weiwei
Y1  - 2020/01/01
PY  - 2020
