T1  - Evidence for an Active, Transcrustal Magma System in the Last 60 ka and Eruptive Degassing Budget (H2O, CO2, S, F, Cl, Br): The Case of Dominica
AU  - d'Augustin, T.
AU  - Balcone-Boissard, H.
