TY  - JOUR
T1  - Mitigating distributed denial of service attacks in satellite networks
AU  - Usman, Muhammad
AU  - Qaraqe, Marwa
AU  - Asghar, Muhammad Rizwan
AU  - Shafique Ansari, Imran
